{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE HARDEST GAME OF 2025? PROVE ME WRONG.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019re patient? Think you\u2019re skilled? <strong>This game will break you.</strong> One misstep, and you\u2019re tumbling back down. <strong>Again. And again. And again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>THE DARUMA CHALLENGE</strong>, you don\u2019t jump\u2014you <strong>bounce.</strong> Every surface is both an opportunity and a trap. <strong>Master the momentum or lose everything.</strong> A <strong>precision platformer</strong> designed to <strong>punish hesitation, crush overconfidence, and reward only the most determined.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/compressed6.gif?t=1744028245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAN YOU REACH THE TOP?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Brutal, physics-based bouncing movement</strong> \u2013 easy to learn, painful to master.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO shortcuts. NO hand-holding. NO easy mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Checkpoints? A well-deserved relief\u2026 but only in Normal Mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time Attack Mode? No checkpoints. No mercy. A nightmare for speedrunners.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secrets &amp; hidden paths? Only for those clever (or stubborn) enough to find them.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453870/extras/compressed3.gif?t=1744028245\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>99% WILL FAIL. WILL YOU?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the Daruma doll\u2019s mantra\u2014<strong>\u201cFall down seven times, stand up eight.\u201d</strong>\u2014this game was built for those who <strong>refuse to quit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most players won\u2019t make it to the end. <strong>Some won\u2019t even survive the first few jumps.</strong> But a few? They\u2019ll <strong>embrace the suffering, push through the pain, and conquer the impossible.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you rage easily, turn back now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was <strong>crafted by a solo developer with care, but not kindness.</strong> Every challenge, every detail\u2014<strong>designed to push you to the limit.</strong> The Daruma always gets back up. <strong>Will you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"STAMINA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/53c73a9a56b1e774a021d3ab5b3d5fde658fb264.jpg"},{"name":"MILD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/1f4d7d16b0dd96d6496c18293ab62666c1ffdca3.jpg"},{"name":"SPICY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/713d7bf0216741a404cce354a4c59d18d5072054.jpg"},{"name":"HOT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/d70fe03a8d1010067743417c6f0903a3a787ddc9.jpg"},{"name":"EXTRA HOT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/0caa8075e36f5495810dbd43e20f635783709192.jpg"},{"name":"LEGEND","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/166a0de3a50f91c3427396291fee147cf696999b.jpg"},{"name":"BABY STEP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/58c597f94cf6d54c46433e78186b6d940cc5209f.jpg"},{"name":"DARKNESS SANCTUARY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3453870/1211557814bbc6ad751db524c19e6ab227fe6595.jpg"},{"name":"WATER SANCTUARY"